XFOIL.next GUI portable distribution
====================================

XFOIL.next
Copyright (C) 2026 Olaf Frommann
https://github.com/of33/XFOIL.next

XFOIL.next is based on XFOIL 6.99 by Mark Drela and Harold Youngren.

This package contains the standalone XFOIL.next graphical application. The
command-line program is distributed separately.

