Bundled components
------------------

* Qt 6.12.0 shared libraries and plugins. Qt is used under the open-source
  LGPLv3/GPLv3 terms. The complete Qt license text is provided in
  licenses/Qt-LGPLv3-GPLv3.txt. Qt is dynamically linked and the shared
  libraries remain replaceable by the recipient.
* QCustomPlot 2.1.1, copyright 2011-2022 Emanuel Eichhammer, licensed under
  GPL-3.0-or-later. Its license text is the GPLv3 text and is provided in
  licenses/QCustomPlot-GPL-3.0.txt.
* The GCC runtime support code, where present, under the GCC Runtime Library
  Exception, version 3.1; see licenses/GCC-RUNTIME-EXCEPTION.txt.
* On Windows, MinGW-w64 runtime and winpthreads notices are included in
  licenses/.

Exact source
------------

The source commit, tree, reference and source-date epoch for this package are
recorded in SOURCE-INFO.txt. The corresponding source is the complete source
tree at that commit. It can be obtained from the project URL above.

The archive is a binary distribution and does not contain the full source
tree.

